OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,FA father from Doncaster tried to save
OL,7,Fhis daughter after she was dragged
OL,8,Finto the sea, but they both drowned,
OL,9,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,11,FJohn Peter Collins, 66, and Samantha
OL,12,FAdele Collins, 32, were pulled from
OL,13,Fthe water at Fistral Beach in Newquay
OL,14,Fon July 26.
OL,16,FCornwall Coroner's Court heard their
OL,17,Ffamily, from Doncaster, South
OL,18,FYorkshire, had been on holiday in the
OL,19,Fseaside town.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
