OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786034874
OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,FAssistant coroner Emma Hillson said:
OL,7,F"Samantha Collins was on holiday with
OL,8,Fher family in Newquay.
OL,10,F"She and her father were fishing on
OL,11,Frocks when Samantha was dragged into
OL,12,Fthe sea.
OL,14,F"John tried to save her, but very
OL,15,Fsadly was unable to so and they both
OL,16,Flost their lives."
OL,18,FAdele Collins, the wife of Mr Collins
OL,19,Fand mother of Miss Collins, identified
OL,20,Ftheir bodies, the hearing was told.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
