OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786034874
OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,FPost-mortem examinations were
OL,7,Fperformed at the Royal Cornwall
OL,8,FHospital in Treliske on July 29.
OL,10,FThe provisional cause of death for
OL,11,Fboth father and daughter was given as
OL,12,Fdrowning.
OL,14,F"Given the reported circumstances of
OL,15,Fthe death, and the provisional cause
OL,16,Fof death, I have reason to suspect the
OL,17,Fdeath may be as a result of an
OL,18,Funnatural cause," the coroner said.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
