OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786034874
OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,F"I am going to adjourn for a
OL,7,Fprovisional full hearing date of July
OL,8,F19 2027 at 10am, with a time estimate
OL,9,Fof three hours.
OL,11,F"This will be a joint inquest."
OL,13,FThe hearing in Truro heard Mr Collins
OL,14,Fwas married and a retired technical
OL,15,Fengineer, while his daughter was
OL,16,Fsingle.
OL,18,FDevon and Cornwall Police previously
OL,19,Fconfirmed officers were called to
OL,20,FFistral Beach at about 9.45pm on July
OL,21,F26.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
