PN,33905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786034874
OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,FBoth Mr Collins and his daughter had
OL,7,Fbeen recovered from the water.
OL,9,FEmergency services attended, but the
OL,10,Fpair were pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,12,FMiss Collins is believed to have
OL,13,Fentered the water carrying a handbag,
OL,14,Fdescribed as orange or peach in
OL,15,Fcolour, with a shoulder strap.
OL,17,FA police spokeswoman previously said
OL,18,Fit was "thought to contain a number of
OL,19,Fpersonal items of great sentimental
OL,20,Fvalue to her loved ones".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
