PN,33906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786034874
OL,3,CFather and daughter died after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty at beach, inquest hears
OL,6,F"At what is an incredibly difficult
OL,7,Ftime for the family, they would take
OL,8,Fgreat comfort in being reunited with
OL,9,Fthese belongings if possible," she
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,FAnyone who finds a bag matching the
OL,13,Fdescription is asked to hand it into
OL,14,FNewquay police station, or to contact
OL,15,Fpolice with the incident number
OL,16,F50260197209.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
